# Tag: an F7 hit on beat 3 and a Bb6/9 button on beat 4, held through the last bar.
# Trumpets F6 D6 C6 G5 (5, 3, 9, 6), saxes the same an octave down, trombones Bb2 F3 C4 D4, bari on Bb2.
